{"openapi":"3.0.2","info":{"title":"Soilgrids REST API","description":"<p>REST API Supporting Soilgrids portal et al.</p>\n                 <strong>For soilgrids FAQ and information:<strong>\n                 <p><a href=\"https://www.isric.org/explore/soilgrids/faq-soilgrids\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.isric.org/explore/soilgrids/faq-soilgrids</a></p>\n                 <p><strong>Please check ISRIC's data policy, disclaimer and citation:</strong></p>\n                 <p><a href=\"https://isric.org/about/data-policy\" target=\"_blank\">https://isric.org/about/data-policy</a></p>                   \n                 ","version":"2.0"},"servers":[{"url":"/soilgrids/v2.0"}],"paths":{"/classification/query":{"get":{"summary":"Queries the WRB layers to extract most probable class, and probably of other classes","description":"Queries the WRB MostProbable vrt layer and the specific WRB class layers to extract probability values\n- **number_classes**: Number of probability classes to return","operationId":"query_layer_wrb_classification_query_get","parameters":[{"description":"Longitude coordinate between -180 and 180","required":true,"schema":{"title":"Lon coordinate","maximum":180.0,"minimum":-180.0,"type":"number","description":"Longitude coordinate between -180 and 180"},"name":"lon","in":"query"},{"description":"Latitude coordinate between 90 and 90","required":true,"schema":{"title":"Lat coordinate","maximum":90.0,"minimum":-90.0,"type":"number","description":"Latitude coordinate between 90 and 90"},"name":"lat","in":"query"},{"description":"Number of WRB probability classes that will be return, ordered from higher to lower percentage","required":false,"schema":{"title":"Number of WRB probablity classes ","type":"integer","description":"Number of WRB probability classes that will be return, ordered from higher to lower percentage","default":5},"name":"number_classes","in":"query"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Generic JSON with WRB classes","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/properties/layers":{"get":{"summary":"Gets the layer structure of soilgrids soil properties","description":"Returns the current avaialble layer structure based on property, available depth and values","operationId":"layers_properties_layers_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Generic JSON with layer structure","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/properties/query":{"get":{"summary":"Queries a single pixel for information","description":"Query a single pixel point on the soilgrids stack, returning a GeoJSON\n\n- **layer**: soilgrids layer name to be queried\n- **depth**: specific depth to be queried\n- **values**: statistical values\nOptional[List] = LayerQuery\n\nCheck the amazon rain forest: lon=-72 lat=-9","operationId":"query_layer_properties_properties_query_get","parameters":[{"description":"Longitude coordinate between -180 and 180","required":true,"schema":{"title":"Lon coordinate","maximum":180.0,"minimum":-180.0,"type":"number","description":"Longitude coordinate between -180 and 180"},"name":"lon","in":"query"},{"description":"Latitude coordinate between 90 and 90","required":true,"schema":{"title":"Lat coordinate","maximum":90.0,"minimum":-90.0,"type":"number","description":"Latitude coordinate between 90 and 90"},"name":"lat","in":"query"},{"required":false,"schema":{"title":"Property","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"default":["bdod","cec","cfvo","clay","nitrogen","ocd","ocs","phh2o","sand","silt","soc","wv0010","wv0033","wv1500"]},"name":"property","in":"query"},{"required":false,"schema":{"title":"Depth","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"default":["0-5cm","0-30cm","5-15cm","15-30cm","30-60cm","60-100cm","100-200cm"]},"name":"depth","in":"query"},{"required":false,"schema":{"title":"Value","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"default":["Q0.05","Q0.5","Q0.95","mean","uncertainty"]},"name":"value","in":"query"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Generic GeoJSON object","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"HTTPValidationError":{"title":"HTTPValidationError","type":"object","properties":{"detail":{"title":"Detail","type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationError"}}}},"ValidationError":{"title":"ValidationError","required":["loc","msg","type"],"type":"object","properties":{"loc":{"title":"Location","type":"array","items":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"integer"}]}},"msg":{"title":"Message","type":"string"},"type":{"title":"Error Type","type":"string"}}}}}}